        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Here, the data you asked for.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks, Ferdinand. I didn't think you'd hand it over personally.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_522_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We were able to retrieve most of the Loken Watertank data thanks to you. The fewer that know about this, the better.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I'm curious as to why you wanted these data.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "She gazes at the monitor in front of her, so focused that even her breathing slows down."
    },
    {
        "text": "A video of a girl with white hair is playing."
    },
    {
        "text": "The girl spends most of her time sleeping, eating, or sitting in a corner with a blank look on her face."
    },
    {
        "text": "From time to time, she is led into a lab, where she crushes furniture placed in a room separated by a 1-meter thick wall."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What a beautiful child.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You remind me of Loken Williams. I thought only madmen boast about their test subjects.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure, he's been accused of crossing a moral line.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Morals are shackles that the short-sighted impose upon themselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_522_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Science has never been bound by common sense. There is no greater insult to a scientist than to be judged by moral standards.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Williams's problem was that he allowed the infinite unknown to get the better of his sanity, and he abandoned the logic and reason a scientist must grip.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "text": "See at the end of the video how your 'beautiful child' turned the lab into a nightmarish catastrophe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "The monitor is showing a different image."
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no recorded sound, but the screams seem to pierce the screen and fill a lab from another time."
    },
    {
        "text": "The fallen debris does not hide the bloodstains."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What happened to the girl?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Records pertaining to her have been tampered with. Like the other legacies of Loken Watertank, she has value to somebody, somewhere.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to find her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_522_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "May I assume you're considering ending Williams's experiments?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "text": "She is too difficult to control. A risk Rhine Lab cannot afford.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She didn't volunteer to be a test subject. I can't ask something so cruel of her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_522_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You want to heal her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're not doctors, but anyone whose seen the experiments in their entirety should not harbor such delusions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, Ferdinand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "All I want to do is find her... and give her a hug.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_522_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A... a hug?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The girl... she's all alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "text": "They took her family from her, and made her something entirely different from all other people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't help but think... where is she now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Has she made new friends? Or new enemies?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to hear her voice...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't change her past, but the future may not be lost yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_522_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know, Dorothy... I really have no idea what you're thinking at times.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not many scientists are as sentimental as you are. You're not bound by logic or reason either. Perhaps, one day, your madness will put Williams's to shame...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Madness? I've seen this in my dreams, many times.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's why I want to find the girl.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If she's still alive... if anyone can save her from her past...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then maybe someone will be there to stop me, if I really do go over the edge.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
